Most awesome lists are a photo of what somebody found interesting one afternoon two
years ago. The links rot and nobody notices.

**This one measures itself.** Volume comes from an API, repo health from GitHub, a
blog's last post from its own feed. Nothing here is a number I typed once and left to
age. Where a cell is blank it's because no free source exists, and the entry tells you
what I looked for.

Every entry is a YAML file in [`data/`](data/). This page is built from them, so don't
edit it, the build will overwrite you. Link-rot sweeps and the submission bot are still
to come ([roadmap](SPEC.md#7-build-order-each-step-ships-something)).

