## Data sources

Beyond a venue you need **history to test a strategy on** and a feed to price against.
That's it.

Platform APIs aren't here. Every venue has one for its own book and you'll find it in
their docs in about thirty seconds, so a row saying "this exchange has an exchange API"
would only push the useful entries further down the page.

